\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.11}{\ignorespaces Realized local epochs per round of FDA-RoLoRA under Dirichlet label skew ($\alpha = 0.5, C = 20$) on MNLI ($e_{\max } = 40, k = 0.5$) and QNLI ($e_{\max } = 20, k = 0.5$); dashed lines mark the setpoint $k \cdot e_{\max }$. Values are seed means.}}{57}{figure.5.11}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.12}{\ignorespaces Convergence and client drift variance trajectories on MNLI and QNLI under severe Dirichlet statistical heterogeneity ($\alpha = 0.5$). Top panels present validation accuracy trajectories; bottom panels present client coordinate drift variance ($\sigma _t^2$). Thin lines show individual seeds; bold lines show the seed mean.}}{58}{figure.5.12}%
